## 5. Method channel wiring (glues Trendit + Topwise together on the Dart side)

Both built-in backends are invoked from Dart through a single channel,
`PrintHelper`, talking to a single native `MethodChannel` named
`com.geepay.pos_mobile/print`, handled in `MainActivity.java`. Copy
`printerhepler.dart` if you want built-in printing callable from Dart at all
(the Bluetooth path doesn't need it).

Channel methods: `printReceipt`, `printZesco`, `printDailySummary` — each maps
1:1 to a method in `MainActivity.java` that tries Topwise first, then falls
back to the inline Trendit code.

